OL,3,GNEWSAOrgreave Inquiry holds community
OL,4,Alistening events
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople with a connection to the 1984
OL,7,FBattle of Orgreave are invited to
OL,8,Fattend community listening events to
OL,9,Fhelp the public inquiry into the
OL,10,Fdispute "understand its lasting
OL,11,Fimpact".
OL,13,FViolence broke out between police
OL,14,Fofficers and miners outside the
OL,15,FOrgreave coking plant in Rotherham on
OL,16,F18 June 1984, in one of the pivotal
OL,17,Fmoments of the 1984`85 miners' strike.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
